WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a kneeling position, extend one leg out to the side.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Hands frame the kneeling leg.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Rock the hips back toward the heel.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Feel the inner thigh of the long leg.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
